This repository is a Claude Code marketplace. It ships a plugin that vendors a
subset of the official Lark/Feishu CLI Agent Skills from:

  https://github.com/larksuite/cli  (path: skills)

It is not an official Lark, Feishu, or ByteDance product.

Vendored under plugins/lark-cli/skills/ :

  lark-doc, lark-wiki, lark-shared

These files remain under the upstream MIT license:

  Copyright (c) 2026 Lark Technologies Pte. Ltd.

They are redistributed with one modification: the line

  disable-model-invocation: true

is added to the YAML frontmatter of each SKILL.md, so the skills stay out of
Claude Code's always-on skill listing and are reachable only by typing
/lark-cli:<name>. No other content is altered.

The upstream commit the current files came from is recorded in
plugins/lark-cli/UPSTREAM_SHA, and scripts/sync-upstream.sh re-vendors them.

Everything else in this repository (marketplace JSON, plugin manifest, scripts,
documentation) is MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 soundadam.
